The license above covers the figure composition and annotations.

Source pixels: Spitzer/SINGS M51 (NGC 5194 and NGC 5195), IRAC channel 1.
Credit: Spitzer/SINGS; NASA/IPAC Infrared Science Archive;
Kennicutt et al. (2003). Dataset DOI: https://doi.org/10.26131/IRSA424

The underlying archival data are publicly reusable with no usage restrictions
under IRSA's public-data policy:
https://irsa.ipac.caltech.edu/data_use_terms.html

The left panel displays a cropped archival image with an asinh intensity
stretch. The center and right panels show a cuPhoton subtraction from a
controlled simulation using that image. Source motion, detector artifacts
and added noise are simulated. The image does not claim an observed transient.
The pinned source URL, checksum and attribution are in source-data.json.
